\dbch\af2\hich\f2\strike0\ulnone\cf2 Highlight:}{\rtlch\af2\alang1025\afs24\ltrch\b0\i0\fs20\lang1033\langnp1033\langfe1033\langfenp1033\loch\af2\dbch\af2\hich\f2\strike0\ulnone\cf2 \~At 79, he is wrapping up the fantastical saga set in motion with \u8220 His Dark Materials,\u8221  while still loath to discuss how his work comments on current events.}
